  "overview": "Standalone total income was flat YoY at INR1,320 crores, with EBITDA down 17% to INR126 crores (9.5% margin) and PAT up 3% to INR31.5 crores. Consolidated total income fell 21% to INR1,534 crores, mainly because of BOT and HAM asset monetisation in Q3 FY26, and consolidated EBITDA fell 55% to INR292 crores (19.0% margin). Management cut FY27 revenue growth guidance to 10-15% from 20% and EBITDA margin to roughly 9-9.5% from about 10%. Order book stood at INR15,251 crores as of 30 June, with about INR450 crores added after quarter-end, and the company is pivoting to international, railway and power T&D work as domestic highway awarding stays subdued.</overview>\n<parameter name=\"financial_highlights\">[{\"metric\":\"Standalone total income\",\"value\":\"INR1,320 crores\",\"change\":\"flat vs INR1,339 crores in Q1 FY26\"},{\"metric\":\"Standalone EBITDA\",\"value\":\"INR126 crores (9.5% margin)\",\"change\":\"down 17% YoY\"},{\"metric\":\"Standalone PAT\",\"value\":\"INR31.5 crores\",\"change\":\"up 3% vs INR30.6 crores in Q1 FY26\"},{\"metric\":\"Consolidated total income\",\"value\":\"INR1,534 crores\",\"change\":\"down 21% vs INR1,937 crores in Q1 FY26\"},{\"metric\":\"Consolidated EBITDA\",\"value\":\"INR292 crores (19.0% margin)\",\"change\":\"down 55% YoY\"},{\"metric\":\"Consolidated PAT\",\"value\":\"INR127 crores\",\"change\":\"YoY change not stated\"},{\"metric\":\"Standalone interest cost\",\"value\":\"About INR60 crores in Q1\",\"change\":\"reduced; management expects around INR50 crores by year-end\"},{\"metric\":\"Q1 revenue from outside India\",\"value\":\"INR145 crores\",\"change\":\"about 80% from Guyana\"},{\"metric\":\"Q1 capex\",\"value\":\"About INR25 crores (INR7 crores international)\",\"change\":\"FY27 target about INR125 crores\"}]",
